#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:1
msgid "剧情梗概"
msgstr "Story Synopsis"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:3
msgid "接触事件（发生在游戏世界）"
msgstr "The Contact Event (occurs in the game world)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:4
msgid "一众艺术家与哲学家不约而同地开始对一个叫做"现实验证"的命题疯狂讨论。"
msgstr ""
"A group of artists and philosophers simultaneously begin feverishly "
"discussing a proposition called \"Reality Verification\"."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:5
msgid "一夜之间，地下城所有的电子屏都被替换成了一张抽象的图像（通过光素的认知更改）"
msgstr ""
"Overnight, all electronic screens in the underground city were replaced "
"with an abstract image (through photonic cognitive alteration)."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:6
msgid ""当我看到这张画的时候，明白了一件事，我只是一个游戏的角色，好像是来自神的命令""
msgstr ""
"\"When I saw this image, I understood one thing: I am merely a game "
"character, as if it were a command from a god.\""

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:7
msgid "接触事件之后，民间自发出现了以那个抽象图像作为象征的组织，自称断网组织，掩人耳目地在危险的地面开始建设基地。"
msgstr ""
"After the Contact Event, a grassroots organization emerged spontaneously, "
"using that abstract image as their symbol. They called themselves the "
"Disconnect Organization and began secretly building bases on the dangerous "
"surface."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:8
msgid "初入世界"
msgstr "Entering the World"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:9
msgid "三人小队成形（完成基本的委托）"
msgstr "The three-person squad is formed (completing basic commissions)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:10
msgid "受命于羽凌灵的我"
msgstr "I, entrusted by Yu Lingling"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:11
msgid "接受任务保护妮妮莉特，但是诸多迹象告诉我事情并没有那么简单。"
msgstr ""
"Accepting the mission to protect Ninillet, but many signs tell me things "
"are not that simple."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:12
msgid "什么是接触事件，究竟发生了什么？"
msgstr "What is the Contact Event? What exactly happened?"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:13
msgid "了解 NPC 是后世界人类人格/思想的模拟产物，不过少数 NPC 的思想人格来自后世界中的某个人"
msgstr ""
"Learn that NPCs are simulated products of post-world human personalities "
"and thoughts, though a few NPCs' personalities come from specific "
"individuals in the post-world."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:14
msgid "这个游戏似乎是某个重要的项目，所有的环境都达到拟真的效果，投资数目肯定不小"
msgstr ""
"This game seems to be some important project. All environments achieve "
"lifelike realism, and the investment must be enormous."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:15
msgid "需要我保护的妮妮利特"
msgstr "Ninillet, the one I need to protect"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:16
msgid "妮妮利特外貌与羽凌灵很像，猜想妮妮莉特就是对应后世界的羽凌灵的人格。妮妮莉特认说自己和羽凌灵完全不一样，很胆小还一直依赖羽凌灵的保护。"
msgstr ""
"Ninillet looks very similar to Yu Lingling. I suspect Ninillet corresponds "
"to Yu Lingling's personality from the post-world. Ninillet says she is "
"completely different from Yu Lingling — very timid and always dependent on "
"Yu Lingling's protection."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:17
msgid "妮妮莉特告诉我她的记忆里，在一次离家出走后，独自开始生活，进入地下城 A 后就一直跟随在（羽凌灵）身边，羽凌灵很照顾她。"
msgstr ""
"Ninillet tells me that in her memories, after running away from home once, "
"she started living on her own. After entering Underground City A, she "
"always stayed by Yu Lingling's side, and Yu Lingling took great care of "
"her."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:18
msgid "羽凌灵被 AI 群攻下线后，军事学院失去领导力，大家都离开了基地，只剩下了妮妮莉特"
msgstr ""
"After Yu Lingling was taken offline by a swarm of AI attacks, the Military "
"Academy lost its leadership. Everyone left the base, and only Ninillet "
"remained."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:19
msgid "看起来可靠的乌云"
msgstr "The Seemingly Reliable Wuyun"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:20
msgid "乌云很早之前就在调查羽凌灵了，并断定我也来自后世界，对我说："我知道你不属于这里"，并声称自己是来帮助我的，于是加入小队。"
msgstr ""
"Wuyun had been investigating Yu Lingling for a long time and concluded that "
"I also come from the post-world. He said to me: \"I know you don't belong "
"here,\" and claimed he was here to help me, thus joining the squad."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:21
msgid "以为自己掌握很多信息为筹码，但是我并不相信他，虽然目前看起来没有恶意，我仍然处处提防着。"
msgstr ""
"He thinks he holds a lot of information as leverage, but I don't trust him. "
"Although he seems to have no ill intentions for now, I remain on guard at "
"all times."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:22
msgid "防备两面的压力（站稳脚跟，调查游戏世界内情况）"
msgstr ""
"Guarding against pressure from both sides (establishing a foothold, "
"investigating the situation within the game world)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:23
msgid "地下城的人以为我来自后世界，因此对我产生敌意，似乎没法在地下城展开调查，妮妮莉特告诉我之前羽凌灵就是在地下城遭遇围攻而受伤下线的。"
msgstr ""
"People in the underground city think I come from the post-world, so they "
"are hostile toward me. It seems impossible to conduct investigations in the "
"underground city. Ninillet told me that Yu Lingling was previously attacked "
"and injured offline in the underground city."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:24
msgid "电梯的巨大震动往往伴随着怪物入侵，我需要维护游戏世界的稳定"
msgstr ""
"The massive vibrations of the elevator are often accompanied by monster "
"invasions. I need to maintain the stability of the game world."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:25
msgid "来自向阳生的橄榄枝"
msgstr "The Olive Branch from Xiangyangsheng"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:26
msgid "证明断网组织是游戏世界混乱的始作俑者"
msgstr ""
"Prove that the Disconnect Organization is the culprit behind the game "
"world's chaos"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:27
msgid "在迷茫的人群中，反常地有组织的目的"
msgstr ""
"Among the confused populace, there is an unusually organized purpose."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:28
msgid "断网组织绑架了多名信息技术员，物理学家"
msgstr ""
"The Disconnect Organization kidnapped multiple IT technicians and physicists."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:29
msgid "行动时间点恰巧与接触时间的吻合"
msgstr "The timing of their actions coincides exactly with the Contact Event."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:30
msgid "羽凌灵来自后世界的信息源正是断网组织"
msgstr ""
"The source of information about Yu Lingling coming from the post-world is "
"precisely the Disconnect Organization."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:31
msgid "断网组织目前正藏匿在地面"
msgstr "The Disconnect Organization is currently hiding on the surface."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:32
msgid "这些人是在接触事件后的激进派，自以为是地认为光能带领他们离开这里，因此听命于乌鸦"
msgstr ""
"These people are radicals after the Contact Event, arrogantly believing "
"that light can lead them away from here, thus following the orders of Crow."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:33
msgid "使用建造巨型射灯通"
msgstr "Use and construct giant spotlights"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:34
msgid "是后世界断网组织在游戏世界中实现断网目的的傀儡"
msgstr ""
"They are puppets of the post-world Disconnect Organization, used to achieve "
"disconnection goals within the game world."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:35
msgid "邀请我加入地面调查队，帮助他维护游戏世界的稳定"
msgstr ""
"Invited me to join the surface investigation team to help maintain the "
"stability of the game world."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:36
msgid "向阳生与我的目标基本一致，人多力量大，加入调查队也解决了来自地下城的压力。p"
msgstr ""
"Xiangyangsheng's goals are basically aligned with mine. There's strength in "
"numbers, and joining the investigation team also relieves the pressure from "
"the underground city."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:37
msgid "同时我也同意了向阳生来到军事学院休整队伍，去地面调查也更加方便"
msgstr ""
"At the same time, I agreed to let Xiangyangsheng come to the Military "
"Academy to rest and regroup. Investigating the surface would also be more "
"convenient."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:38
msgid "地面探查"
msgstr "Surface Exploration"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:39
msgid "缺少医疗补给，邀请医疗组姐弟常驻学院"
msgstr ""
"Short on medical supplies, inviting the sibling medical team to be "
"stationed at the academy."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:40
msgid "信息技术员余子绛常驻学院"
msgstr "IT technician Yu Zijiang stationed at the academy."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:41
msgid "遭遇过断网组织的威胁，逃脱成功后来到学院寻求庇护（威胁她的人已经死了，应该是她自己动的手）"
msgstr ""
"Previously threatened by the Disconnect Organization, escaped successfully "
"and came to the academy seeking refuge (the person who threatened her is "
"already dead, likely killed by her own hand)."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:42
msgid "经由向阳生引荐帮助军事学院开发 VR 战斗训练系统和武器研发，常驻于研发室"
msgstr ""
"Recommended by Xiangyangsheng to help the Military Academy develop a VR "
"combat training system and weapons R&D, stationed at the development lab."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:43
msgid "李叶娜是向阳生小组的领队"
msgstr "Li Yena is the leader of Xiangyangsheng's squad."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:44
msgid "放弃舞蹈事业毅然投靠向阳生的小队，心里一直有一个世界和平的理想"
msgstr ""
"Gave up a dance career to resolutely join Xiangyangsheng's squad, always "
"holding an ideal of world peace in her heart."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:45
msgid "逐渐成长并成为领队"
msgstr "Gradually grew and became the squad leader."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:46
msgid "阿岩帮助改造基地，后来在地面发现其尸体，因为他想找寻记忆中和女友去过的地方，验证自己女友只存在记忆中还是真实存在的。"
msgstr ""
"A Yan helped renovate the base. Later, his body was found on the surface — "
"he went to find a place he and his girlfriend had visited in his memories, "
"to verify whether his girlfriend only existed in memory or was real."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:47
msgid "在一次落荒而逃中误入世外桃源，认识万薇莉，这里的人懂得如何和怪物和谐相处，领养了一只大狐狸加入我们一起战斗（大狐狸也可以被训练）"
msgstr ""
"While fleeing in panic, accidentally stumbled into a hidden paradise and met "
"Wan Weili. The people here know how to coexist peacefully with monsters. "
"Adopted a large fox that joined us in battle (the fox can also be trained)."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:48
msgid "乌云在地面与我们打入断网组织基地"
msgstr "Wuyun fought alongside us to infiltrate the Disconnect Organization's base on the surface."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:49
msgid "在断网组织基地内寻找到断网组织建设的巨型射灯"
msgstr ""
"Found the giant spotlight built by the Disconnect Organization inside their "
"base."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:50
msgid "将纹身置入射灯作为信标，打开了一条与后世界沟通的光柱（其实游戏世界中只有乌云一人能够"飞升"）"
msgstr ""
"Placed the tattoo into the spotlight as a beacon, opening a light pillar "
"for communication with the post-world (in reality, only Wuyun in the game "
"world can \"ascend\")."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:51
msgid "在后世界中的断网组织通过光柱，能够对游戏世界的形态和参数造成极大的影响"
msgstr ""
"Through the light pillar, the Disconnect Organization in the post-world can "
"exert enormous influence on the game world's form and parameters."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:52
msgid "看见乌云的手臂被光柱的数据流冲毁，但是他毅然决然跃进数据流之中。"
msgstr ""
"Saw Wuyun's arm being destroyed by the data stream of the light pillar, but "
"he resolutely leapt into the data stream."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:53
msgid "羽凌灵上线"
msgstr "Yu Lingling Comes Online"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:54
msgid "乌云成功实现"飞升"的理想，（寄生于后世界的一只机械狗，却发现这里的人都想进入游戏世界，但自己已经失去了回到游戏世界的能力）"
msgstr ""
"Wuyun successfully realized his dream of \"ascension\" (parasitically "
"inhabiting a mechanical dog in the post-world, only to discover that "
"everyone there wants to enter the game world, but he has already lost the "
"ability to return)."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:55
msgid "羽凌灵基本康复上线，在未实现联网功能的游戏世界，我和羽凌灵同时在线，我的身份似乎也很神秘。"
msgstr ""
"Yu Lingling has mostly recovered and comes online. In a game world that "
"hasn't yet achieved network connectivity, Yu Lingling and I are online "
"simultaneously — my identity seems quite mysterious too."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:56
msgid "通过羽凌灵得知，游戏公司决定加快联网测试的进程，赶在断网组织对世界造成过大的破坏之前完成。"
msgstr ""
"Learned from Yu Lingling that the game company decided to accelerate the "
"network testing process, aiming to complete it before the Disconnect "
"Organization causes too much damage to the world."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:57
msgid "为什么联网就代表成功？游戏世界为什么这么重要？"
msgstr "Why does networking mean success? Why is the game world so important?"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:58
msgid "大挫折"
msgstr "Major Setback"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:59
msgid "断网组织快速地刷新出大量受其控制的怪物，发动突袭式总攻，侵入基地与地下城。"
msgstr ""
"The Disconnect Organization rapidly spawned massive numbers of monsters "
"under their control, launching a surprise all-out assault, invading both "
"the base and the underground city."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:60
msgid "在基地发生战斗，常驻基地的人员全部领盒饭"
msgstr ""
"Battle broke out at the base. All personnel stationed there were killed "
"off."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:61
msgid "转折"
msgstr "Turning Point"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:62
msgid "在刍狗的帮助下玉植入进入游戏之中，"
msgstr ""
"With the help of the Chugou Organization, Yu was implanted into the game."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:63
msgid "双子被玉所解救，在与玉会合时了解双子"
msgstr ""
"The twins were rescued by Yu. Upon reuniting with Yu, they learned about "
"the twins."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:64
msgid "玉从一个独立的 AI 个体快速成长，开始理解游戏世界的一切，拥有近乎神迹的力量。"
msgstr ""
"Yu rapidly grew from an independent AI entity, beginning to understand "
"everything about the game world, possessing near-divine power."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:65
msgid "再转折"
msgstr "Another Turning Point"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:66
msgid "玉逐渐发现了自己可以改变游戏世界事物的超能力，这种超感也使得其原本带有的人性的情感逐渐消失，失去了目标与立场。"
msgstr ""
"Yu gradually discovered the superpower to alter things in the game world. "
"This hypersense also caused the originally human emotions to gradually "
"disappear, losing purpose and stance."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:67
msgid "由于基地被严重破坏，小队元气大伤失去战斗能力，短期内没有办法抵抗断网组织"
msgstr ""
"Due to severe damage to the base, the squad was devastated and lost combat "
"capability. In the short term, there was no way to resist the Disconnect "
"Organization."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:68
msgid "结局"
msgstr "Ending"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:69
msgid "最后玩家和妮妮莉特孤立无援，后世界时间被暂停"
msgstr ""
"In the end, the player and Ninillet are isolated without help, and time in "
"the post-world is suspended."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/story-scripting/game0/game-summary.md:70
msgid "向阳生背叛我，倒插我一刀，具体原因可以让玩家自己猜测（向阳生发现我是这个世界的主导者）"
msgstr ""
"Xiangyangsheng betrayed me, stabbing me in the back. The specific reason "
"can be left for the player to guess (Xiangyangsheng discovered that I am "
"the dominant entity of this world)."
